      "text": "数百模块自由装配，早期成长模块还能影响全队机甲",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Pick from hundreds of unique modules and assemble them to forge a combat style that’s truly your own. Whether it's ruthless firebringer, agile striker, or combat engineer, the way you fight is defined by how you assemble. What if you're lucky enough to find a growth-type module in early game and slot it into your command panel which affects all the mechs...",
